<article class="env-definition" id="E05649">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/E05649">Definition <span data-tag="E05649">7.3.4.2</span>.</a>filtered colimit!left exactness of Let $\calC $ be a presentable $\infty $-category. We will say that <em>filtered colimits in $\calC $ are left exact</em> if the following condition is satisfied: for every small filtered $\infty $-category $\calI $, the colimit functor $\Fun (\calI ,\calC ) \rightarrow \calC $ is left exact. </p>
